 "name_en": "Customer Returns for Sales Kits (5CX)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Customer Returns for Sales Kits (5CX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa21010b1ed4244489b7bc55bdb50b4f8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21010b1ed4244489b7bc55bdb50b4f8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Companies often want to return individual products that are bundled into a sales kit (for example selling a PC together with monitor, keyboard, mouse, license, and so on). In such cases, sales kits are commonly used to sell and return individual products independently from the bundled product. Bills of materials (BOMs) are used to bundle sales kits.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The customer returns process in returns management supports BOMs. The process starts with customer returns order creation. The sales kit material is then logistically received into the plant. Subsequently, a credit memo or replacement material is provided to customer as compensation.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Once you've entered a bill of material in a customer returns order, the system runs pricing and logistics execution at the following levels:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Header level (ERLA): usually used when product is assembled</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Item level (LUMF): usually used when product is not assembled</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Both Levels (CPFH): pricing happens on header and logistics (goods movements) on item level</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Both Levels (DISH): pricing happens on item and logistics (goods movement) on header level</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21010b1ed4244489b7bc55bdb50b4f8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create customer returns order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Pick and post goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform material inspection</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send back to customer, move to free available stock or scrap</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit memo or send replacement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display return overview</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21010b1ed4244489b7bc55bdb50b4f8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase process flexibility within returns order processing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enhance efficiency in the comprehensive returns process</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>销售包的客户退货 (5CX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa21010b1ed4244489b7bc55bdb50b4f8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21010b1ed4244489b7bc55bdb50b4f8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">公司通常希望退回捆绑到销售包中的单个产品（例如，将 PC 与显示器、键盘、鼠标、许可证等一起销售）。在这种情况下，销售包通常用于独立于捆绑产品销售和退回单个产品。物料清单 (BOM) 用于捆绑销售包。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">退货管理中的客户退货流程支持物料清单。该流程从创建客户退货订单开始。然后将销售包物料以物流方式接收到工厂中。随后，将贷项凭证或替换物料作为补偿提供给客户。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在客户退货订单中输入物料清单后，系统将在以下级别运行定价和物流执行：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 抬头级别 (ERLA)：通常在产品装配后使用</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 项目级别 (LUMF)：通常在产品未装配时使用</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 两个级别 (CPFH)：定价发生在抬头级别，物流（货物移动）发生在项目级别</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 两个级别 (DISH)：定价发生在项目，物流（货物移动）发生在抬头级别</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21010b1ed4244489b7bc55bdb50b4f8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建客户退货订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">拣配和过账收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行物料检验</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发送回客户，移至免费可用库存或报废</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建贷项凭证或发送替换</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示退货概览</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa21010b1ed4244489b7bc55bdb50b4f8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提高退货订单处理中的流程灵活性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高综合退货流程的效率</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
